00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,276
One more fact.

2
00:00:01,276 --> 00:00:10,846
In a tetrahedral complex only four ligands approach, between the axes, so the pattern flips and the splitting is just four ninths as large.

3
00:00:10,846 --> 00:00:14,687
Tetrahedral complexes are almost always high spin.

